      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": "gr.l0.ch2",
      "name": "名词从句 that-clause",
      "chapter_label": "第 2 类",
      "numeric_label": "2.3",
      "pages": [],
      "summary": "that 引导名词从句作主 / 宾 / 表 / 同位语。宾语从句中 that 常可省略。",
